Attribution
================================================================================

The design of this library — the OffloadConfig-style configuration object,
the discovery/profiling iteration concept, the include/exclude pattern matcher,
and the strategy registry (greedy / adaptive / knapsack) — is inspired by:

    FlexTensor — Tensor offloading and management for PyTorch
    https://github.com/ai-dynamo/flextensor
    Copyright (c) 2025-2026, NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This library is an independent TypeScript adaptation. It does NOT include or
link any FlexTensor source code. No PyTorch, CUDA, or NVIDIA software is
required, distributed, or linked. The original FlexTensor library targets
GPU/CPU tensor offloading; this adaptation generalises the core ideas
(profile → tier → auto-offload hot/cold data) to arbitrary keyed values in
browser and Node.js runtimes.

See ATTRIBUTIONS.md for additional details.
